{
    "background_story": "Weston was a charismatic event planner known for his extravagant weddings and parties. He had a tendency to overdo every detail, from the elaborate decorations to the lavish catering. While his clients often appreciated his attention to detail, they sometimes felt overwhelmed by the sheer scale of his productions. Weston's biggest challenge came when he was hired to plan a high-profile celebrity wedding. He spared no expense, booking a private island and importing exotic flowers from around the world. However, his over-the-top approach led to a series of mishaps, including a cake collapse and a misplaced wedding ring. Despite the chaos, Weston's creativity and quick thinking saved the day, and the wedding was hailed as a success. He learned a valuable lesson about finding a balance between perfection and restraint.",
